{"ts":"2026-11-12T17:56:46.873Z","actor":"claude","stage":"factcheck","action":"factcheck.review","details":{"verdict":"pass","notes":"Visual rebuild, narration unchanged. Hook journey: Earth→Proxima Centauri '4.24 light-years' (proxima-distance), clock 'At Voyager's speed' 0→75,000 yrs (voyager1-speed-nasa) — matches 'Seventy-five thousand years… Voyager 1 would need to reach the nearest star'; the ship icon is a generic traveller, Voyager is not actually heading to Proxima, and the narration says 'would need'. Voyager scene: real Voyager 1 launch photo (PIA21747, NASA/JPL/KSC, credit on screen); chips 'VOYAGER 1 · 17 KM/S' and 'STILL 75,000 YEARS TO PROXIMA' (voyager1-speed-nasa). Starshot journey: clock 'Starshot, 15% of c' 0→28 yrs (starshot-speed). Ship-clock journey: 'On board' 0→10 min (lorentz-clock: 4.24 yr ÷ 223,000 ≈ 10 min) and 'On Earth' 0→4.24 yrs (at nearly light speed Earth time ≈ distance in light-years: proxima-distance + light-year). Scale and compare unchanged."},"gitSha":"56e31e5"}
